<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Conditions & Guidance — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fffdf9;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#556;--accent:#8da77b;--ink:#07121a}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(7,18,26,0.04);position:sticky;top:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.85),transparent);z-index:20}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#7fb0d0);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 8px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:920px;margin:36px auto;padding:0 20px}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .intro{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:18px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:18px}
    .list{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(7,18,26,0.04)}
    .item{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border-left:4px solid rgba(7,18,26,0.02);margin-bottom:10px}
    .item h3{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    aside{position:relative}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(141,167,123,0.06),rgba(127,176,208,0.04));padding:16px;border-radius:10px}
    .badge{display:inline-block;background:var(--card);padding:6px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    footer{margin:42px 0 120px 0;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}
    /* small details */
    .alert{background:#fff7e6;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(7,18,26,0.03)}
    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">HM</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Educational guidance and community tracks</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Health Notes</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach Us</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h1>Conditions we commonly support</h1>
    <p class="intro">Below are areas where our integrative, cohort-based approach often helps people find clearer, steadier patterns. This page is educational: it outlines typical offerings and referral considerations rather than specific medical advice.</p>

    <div class="grid">
      <section class="list">
        <div class="item" id="stress">
          <h3>Stress reactivity & sleep fragmentation</h3>
          <div class="muted">Common themes: trouble settling at night, waking early, racing mind, daytime tension.</div>
          <p style="margin-top:8px">Practical support focuses on routine, nervous-system skills, short evening rituals, and group accountability so you can test gentle shifts and see what helps. Those with severe insomnia or other sleep disorders should continue specialist care; we coordinate with providers when needed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="item" id="digestive">
          <h3>Digestive discomfort & sensitivity</h3>
          <div class="muted">Common themes: bloating, irregular bowel habits, food-related reactions.</div>
          <p style="margin-top:8px">Cohorts emphasize simple tracking, pattern recognition, and low-burden dietary changes to reduce symptom load. We do not diagnose or replace gastroenterology; urgent red flags (weight loss, bleeding, severe pain) require immediate medical evaluation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="item" id="fatigue">
          <h3>Low energy & post-exertional malaise</h3>
          <div class="muted">Common themes: afternoon crashes, difficulty sustaining activity, fluctuating capacity.</div>
          <p style="margin-top:8px">We help design pacing strategies, graded routines, and nutrition patterns that stabilize energy. For suspected serious systemic causes (e.g., untreated thyroid disease, cardiac concerns), we encourage parallel medical assessment.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="item" id="pain">
          <h3>Persistent pain and movement limits</h3>
          <div class="muted">Common themes: chronic back pain, joint stiffness, movement avoidance.</div>
          <p style="margin-top:8px">Work focuses on small, sustainable movement habits, breath and body-awareness, and progressive loading in a safe group environment. If you have red-flag symptoms like new neurological changes, we recommend urgent specialist referral.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="item" id="hormones">
          <h3>Menstrual & hormonal rhythm concerns</h3>
          <div class="muted">Common themes: irregular cycles, premenstrual distress, perimenopausal transitions.</div>
          <p style="margin-top:8px">Education on lifestyle supports for hormonal balance is offered; we collaborate with endocrine or gynecologic care when hormone replacement or complex testing is indicated.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="item" id="postcovid">
          <h3>Post-viral recovery & long-tail symptoms</h3>
          <div class="muted">Common themes: lingering fatigue, brain fog, exercise intolerance.</div>
          <p style="margin-top:8px">Our cohorts can help reframe pacing, activity, and supportive routines. Because presentations vary widely, we emphasize slow, measurable adjustments and work alongside your medical team.</p>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="panel">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div class="badge">Helpful note</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Cohort learning model</div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px" class="muted">Our cohorts aim to teach replicable skills — tracking patterns, small behavior experiments, and peer problem-solving — not to replace individualized medical evaluation.</div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px" class="alert">
            <strong style="display:block">Important disclaimer</strong>
            <div class="disclaimer">Information here is educational. It is not medical advice. If you have an urgent concern, signs of infection, sudden or severe symptoms, or ongoing complex illness, please seek immediate medical care or discuss referrals with your primary clinician.</div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <a href="book.html" style="display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none">Start with an intake</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">
          <div><strong>Location:</strong> {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px"><strong>Contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <div>If you're unsure whether cohort care is right for you, our intake can help map options. Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> to discuss.</div>
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>"} 
